    'Dorsal midbrain (Parinaud) syndrome: up-gaze palsy, light–near dissociation, convergence–retraction nystagmus, lid retraction.', "Dorsal o'rta miya (Parinaud) sindromi: yuqoriga qarash falaji, yorug'lik–yaqin dissotsiatsiyasi, konvergensiya–retraksiya nistagmi, qovoq tortilishi.",
